#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.9.0"
msgstr "v2.9.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.9.0 introduces initial **FLIR Lepton** thermal-camera module support "
"(Lepton SDK, module-ID detection, 16-bit camera-bus register addressing) and"
" switches windowing to software cropping for more reliable DMA transfers. "
"The :func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword was removed — read the "
"breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.9.0 introduceert de eerste ondersteuning voor de **FLIR Lepton** "
"thermische cameramodule (Lepton SDK, detectie van module-ID, 16-bits "
"adressering van camera-busregisters) en schakelt windowing over naar "
"software-cropping voor betrouwbaardere DMA-overdrachten. Het ``line_filter``"
" keyword van :func:`sensor.snapshot` is verwijderd — lees hieronder de "
"breaking changes."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Hoogtepunten"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — initial thermal-camera module support (Lepton SDK, module-"
"ID detection)."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — eerste ondersteuning voor de thermische cameramodule "
"(Lepton SDK, detectie van module-ID)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**16-bit camera-bus registers** — supports sensors (like the Lepton) with "
"16-bit register addresses."
msgstr ""
"**16-bits camera-busregisters** — ondersteunt sensoren (zoals de Lepton) met"
" 16-bits registeradressen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Software cropping** — windowing now uses software cropping for more "
"reliable DMA transfer sizes."
msgstr ""
"**Software-cropping** — windowing gebruikt nu software-cropping voor "
"betrouwbaardere DMA-overdrachtsgroottes."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the :func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword was "
"removed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Breaking:** het ``line_filter`` keyword van :func:`sensor.snapshot` is "
"verwijderd — zie de breaking changes."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:30
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nieuwe functies"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — added the FLIR Lepton module, Lepton SDK, Lepton module-ID"
" support, and the ability for sensors to override the default snapshot "
"function (so the Lepton can provide its own capture path)."
msgstr ""
"**FLIR Lepton** — de FLIR Lepton-module, de Lepton SDK, ondersteuning voor "
"de Lepton module-ID en de mogelijkheid voor sensoren om de standaard "
"snapshot-functie te overschrijven toegevoegd (zodat de Lepton zijn eigen "
"capture-pad kan leveren)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:35
msgid "**Camera bus** — added 16-bit register-address support."
msgstr ""
"**Camera-bus** — ondersteuning voor 16-bits registeradressen toegevoegd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:38
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Overige wijzigingen en verbeteringen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"Switched from DCMI hardware cropping to software cropping (fixing issues "
"with some DMA transfer sizes), moved ``bayer_to_rgb565`` into ``imlib``, and"
" added the WINC SPI prescaler to the board configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Overgeschakeld van DCMI hardware-cropping naar software-cropping (waarmee "
"problemen met sommige DMA-overdrachtsgroottes zijn opgelost), "
"``bayer_to_rgb565`` naar ``imlib`` verplaatst en de WINC SPI-prescaler "
"toegevoegd aan de boardconfiguratiebestanden."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:45
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Foutoplossingen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"Fixed SD-card issues (disabled the USB IRQ during non-DMA SD transfers), "
"JPEG Bayer bounds, and added a sensor window-size check."
msgstr ""
"SD-kaartproblemen opgelost (de USB IRQ uitgeschakeld tijdens niet-DMA SD-"
"overdrachten), JPEG Bayer-grenzen, en een controle op de venstergrootte van "
"de sensor toegevoegd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:51
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardware- en boardondersteuning"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:53
msgid "**FLIR Lepton** thermal-camera module (initial support)."
msgstr "**FLIR Lepton** thermische cameramodule (eerste ondersteuning)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:56
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API-wijzigingen"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.8.0 and v2.9.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Voor gebruikers zichtbare API-breaks tussen v2.8.0 en v2.9.0. Reikwijdte: "
"Python C-modules in ``modules/`` en Python-bibliotheken in "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:61
msgid ""
"The breaking change is *minor* and only affects scripts that used the "
"``line_filter`` snapshot keyword. Each commit hash links to its diff on "
"GitHub."
msgstr ""
"De breaking change is *minor* en treft alleen scripts die het "
"``line_filter`` snapshot-keyword gebruikten. Elke commit-hash linkt naar de "
"bijbehorende diff op GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:68
msgid ":func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword removed *(minor)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.snapshot` ``line_filter`` keyword verwijderd *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:70
msgid ""
"The ``line_filter`` keyword argument (a per-line filter callback) was "
"removed from :func:`sensor.snapshot`. Scripts that passed "
"``sensor.snapshot(line_filter=...)`` must drop that argument and perform any"
" per-line processing on the returned image instead."
msgstr ""
"Het ``line_filter`` keyword-argument (een per-regel filter-callback) is "
"verwijderd uit :func:`sensor.snapshot`\\ . Scripts die "
"``sensor.snapshot(line_filter=...)`` doorgaven moeten dat argument "
"verwijderen en eventuele per-regel verwerking in plaats daarvan op de "
"geretourneerde afbeelding uitvoeren."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:75
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `f7e691e39 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f7e691e39>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `f7e691e39 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/f7e691e39>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:80
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migratiechecklist"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.9.0.rst:82
msgid ""
"Remove the ``line_filter`` keyword from :func:`sensor.snapshot` calls and "
"process the returned image instead (:ref:`the line_filter removal "
"<v2_9_0_linefilter>`). All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Verwijder het ``line_filter`` keyword uit :func:`sensor.snapshot`\\ "
"-aanroepen en verwerk in plaats daarvan de geretourneerde afbeelding (\\ "
":ref:`de verwijdering van line_filter <v2_9_0_linefilter>`\\ ). Alle andere "
"scripts draaien ongewijzigd."
